  "description": "Fixes SQLITE_BUSY / \"database is locked\" / SQLITE_BUSY_SNAPSHOT errors in Entity\n            Framework Core + SQLite apps. Provides Channel-based write serialization, automatic\n            BEGIN IMMEDIATE transaction upgrades, exponential-backoff retry, WAL-mode optimization,\n            and 10x faster bulk inserts. Drop-in replacement for UseSqlite() targeting .NET 10\n            and netstandard 2.0.",
